\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Chain, no defence, Task Family B. $\bar  s$ is the mean controlled per-edge survival. Per-edge order follows the chain. Rows marked $\dagger $ used the fresh-artefact protocol (Section\nonbreakingspace \ref {sec:ablation}); others used the default fixed-artefact protocol, which is why both are reported in Table\nonbreakingspace \ref {tab:ablation} for the models where we have both. An independent replicate of the DeepSeek cell gave $\mathrm  {ASR} = 0.375$ with per-edge $0.700/0.733/0.833$, illustrating the sampling variability at $n = 40$ that the MDE of Section\nonbreakingspace 3.7 quantifies.}}{5}{table.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
